    <h2>What to expect</h2>
    <p>Walk-ins are welcome and you don't need an appointment. About a hundred fixtures and fans are on display at any given time, and we rotate them, so there's something new most visits — chandeliers, pendants, sconces, vanity lights, ceiling fans, exterior lights and lamps.</p>
    <p>Come look. Nobody's going to follow you around. When you want help, somebody will be there, and if you'd rather have an hour with someone who'll go room by room with you, <a href="/lighting-consultation/">book a lighting consultation</a> — it's free.</p>
    <p>There's usually wine. Occasionally there's Mahjong.</p>
    <h2>Getting here</h2>
    <p>We're on Old Wellborn Road in south College Station, easy to reach from Bryan, Wellborn and anywhere in the Brazos Valley. Look for Suite 400, or tap <a href="{{ site.mapsUrl }}" rel="noopener">Get Directions</a> for turn-by-turn.</p>
